# Mass Polymorph: "Exile all creatures you control, then reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal that
# many creature cards." Tokens that are exiled count for "that many" (CR 111.7: they cease to exist, but they were
# creatures exiled): Bot1's two Faerie tokens and one Llanowar Elves make the number 3, so three creature cards are
# revealed and put onto the battlefield, past three Islands that stay in the library. Only the Llanowar Elves card is in
